          "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14",
          "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nThe following are equivalent\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> The morphism <MATH_0002> is locally of finite type.\n<STRUCT_0004> For all affine opens <MATH_0003>, <MATH_0004>\nwith <MATH_0005> the ring map\n<MATH_0006> is of finite type.\n<STRUCT_0005> There exist an open covering <MATH_0007>\nand open coverings <MATH_0008> such\nthat each of the morphisms <MATH_0009>, <MATH_0010>\nis locally of finite type.\n<STRUCT_0006> There exist an affine open covering <MATH_0011>\nand affine open coverings <MATH_0012> such\nthat the ring map <MATH_0013> is\nof finite type, for all <MATH_0014>.\n<STRUCT_0007>\nMoreover, if <MATH_0015> is locally of finite type then for\nany open subschemes <MATH_0016>, <MATH_0017> with <MATH_0018>\nthe restriction <MATH_0019> is locally of finite type.\n<STRUCT_0008>",
          "source_status": "CURRENT",
          "placeholders": {
            "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}",
            "LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-locally-finite-type-characterize}",
            "MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$",
